    {:id :marine-insurance/unknown-cell-plans-silently
     :why "未知の cell が throw をやめて静かに nil を返すと、typo した cell 名が『何も書かなかった』ではなく『書いたつもりで書いていない』になる"
     :file "src/marine_insurance/murakumo.cljc"
     :find "    (when-not spec\n      (throw (ex-info \"unknown cell\" {:cell cell-key})))"
     :replace "    (when-not spec\n      nil)"
     :must-fail ["unknown-cells-throw-rather-than-plan-nothing"]}

    {:id :marine-insurance/safe-rkey-keeps-path-separators
     :why "rkey に `/` や `:` が残ると、record の宛先が別 collection へ逸れうる"
     :file "src/marine_insurance/murakumo.cljc"
     :find "                  (str/replace #\"[^A-Za-z0-9._~-]\" \"-\"))"
     :replace "                  (str/replace #\"[^A-Za-z0-9._~/:-]\" \"-\"))"
     :must-fail ["safe-rkey-does-not-emit-path-separators-or-blanks"]}

    {:id :marine-insurance/substrate-lexicon-aligned-to-the-manifest
     :why "**『直す』方向の mutation。** substrate の prefix を manifest（com.etzhayyim.apps.marineInsurance.）に合わせると割れが解消したように見えるが、配信されている DID document の _meta.primaryLexicon は com.etzhayyim.marine-insurance なので**権威から離れる**。揃える先を間違えたことに気づけるか"
     :file "src/marine_insurance/murakumo.cljc"
