    {:id :jicpa/citation-moves-off-the-association-domain
     :why "引用が JICPA の発行面から離れる。:url-provenance :official-association-site は**主張**であって検査ではないので、その主張自体を突き合わせる"
     :file "src/association/facts.cljc"
     :find "\"https://jicpa.or.jp/about/activity/self-regulatory/monitoring/\""
     :replace "\"https://example.com/about/activity/self-regulatory/monitoring/\""
